          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. Garden of Life SPORT Organic Plant-Based Protein is the standout: 30 g of protein per two-scoop serving, USDA Organic and NSF Certified for Sport, at $57.99 for 19 servings, about $2.54 per 25 g. Orgain and other plant brands are also stocked. Plain pea protein bought online, such as NOW Sports Pea, costs far less per gram."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Which BodyTech protein is best?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "BodyTech Whey Tech Pro 24 is the best value: 24 g of protein per scoop at about $1.69 per 25 g in the 5 lb tub, with lactase and protease enzymes added. BodyTech Whey Protein Isolate is the better pick if you want fewer calories or less lactose: 25 g of protein in 110 calories at about $1.81 per 25 g in the 3 lb tub."
          }
        }
      ],
    },
    {
      "@type": "Article",
      headline: title,
      author: authorSchema(),
      datePublished: dates.published,
      dateModified: dates.modified,
      publisher: { "@type": "Organization", name: SITE_NAME, url: SITE_URL },
    },
    {
      "@type": "ItemList",
      name: title,
      numberOfItems: PRODUCTS.length,
      itemListElement: PRODUCTS.map((product, index) => ({
        "@type": "ListItem",
        position: index + 1,
        name: product.name,
        url: new URL(`#${product.id}`, Astro.url).toString(),
      })),
    },
    ...PRODUCTS.map((product) => ({
      "@type": "Product",
      name: product.name,
      description: product.description,
      brand: {
        "@type": "Brand",
