          </p>

          <p>
            Watch for multi-buy promotions. Vitamin Shoppe has run Buy One, Get One 50% Off offers on protein; when one applies to two tubs of the same price, each tub effectively costs 25 percent less, which is a better discount than Auto Delivery. Promotions change week to week and are sometimes applied only in the cart, so check the final price before you check out.
          </p>

          <p>
            Buy the right size. BodyTech's isolate costs about $2.00 per 25 g in the 15.3 oz tub, $1.91 in the 1.5 lb tub, $1.81 in the 3 lb tub and, by our estimate from the tub weight, about $1.60 in the 5 lb. Isopure Zero Carb drops from about $2.93 an ounce in the 14.32 oz tub to $2.37 in the 3.96 lb. Small tubs are for trying a flavor, not for regular use.
          </p>

